AssetPort-CN
============

This project includes and modifies software from Asset-Port:

  Upstream project: https://github.com/Colosyn/Asset-Port
  Original author: Colosyn (Shahnawaz Hussain)
  Original license: MIT License

The original copyright notice and MIT License are preserved in LICENSE.
AssetPort-CN is an independently maintained Chinese edition recognized by the
original author. It remains under the maintainer's control and is not part of
the upstream project's release artifacts.

AssetPort-CN modifications include bilingual Chinese/English UI support,
automatic material fallback generation, texture compression rules, and
compatibility with common prefixless marketplace asset names. Later additions
include Atlas integration, Deferred Decal material support, Static Mesh LOD
import, bilingual master-material groups and guidance, and bilingual documentation.

